OL,3,GNEWSA'It was some buzz': Student band
OL,4,Awho went from pub gigs to JLS opener
OL,5,
OL,6,FDaniel Coulter and his band 4amclub
OL,7,Fhave been around the pub gig scene for
OL,8,Fthe last three years, playing shows to
OL,9,Fmostly modest crowds.
OL,11,FStill searching for a big break, the
OL,12,Fstudents entered a music competition
OL,13,Fafter it was mentioned by a lecturer
OL,14,Fafter class, sent a few songs across
OL,15,Fand thought nothing more of it.
OL,17,FThey had no idea what to expect, later
OL,18,Farriving to a basic set up of some
OL,19,Famps, no real sound equipment, 'and
OL,20,Fsome guy named Carl'.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
