OL,3,GNEWSA'It was some buzz': Student band
OL,4,Awho went from pub gigs to JLS opener
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, the judge was impressed and
OL,7,Fthe band landed the biggest gig in
OL,8,Ftheir short career, and on Saturday
OL,9,Fnight opened for UK pop giants JLS.
